        {
          "text": "Jewish Telegraphic Agency",
          "url": "https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fe.mail.artnews.com%2Fclick%3FZTJBNS8QwEED7W3Leoflo0-2elFUQkb0oHrws02S27bJJliS1iPjfJeCCzPEx83jzOLkwoXNk7zBmT2sqvmr_zdxs2Y6JrpctV5J3quWorbJabUVHW7ZhJrMduzoDGDOUVTCNRTsYcxp0o4j3fSfbvjNt0-hBtFaBYBsWy91_MvZTvd-eULrPGUtrLbnUteC16OvxEga81BhH8nn2mOBM65wmGHExU0jglkSLg8-wJsgBUsYvCFfygG62cCG0FNM0X-FEi61eP56ODr3B6Gk9Phze7g-CyzLaSKU7ue2rF4y6GjHb3IzV8w3v__DvAA8sd71802bd&data=05%7C02%7Chmohammed%40artnews.com%7C3477edb9254b4d15815208df2eaedd8c%7Ce950f25546e44144a778a6ff4f557492%7C0%7C0%7C639281000750519639%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=yprBkZUlWsB0ld9m3pcKX4UNX9BWnqbdbMRl4c%2FgY7g%3D&reserved=0"
